# =============================================================================
# Lambda-F Engine — .gitignore
#
# IP PROTECTION NOTICE
# --------------------
# The Lambda-F patent (E5 embodiment) is provisionally filed but NOT yet
# published. Planning docs, patent text, and the patent-claim-to-code map are
# TRADE SECRETS until publication (~mid-2027 per US provisional → non-provisional
# timeline). Public disclosure before filing completion can:
#   - Forfeit foreign filing rights in some jurisdictions
#   - Provide competitive roadmap intelligence
#   - Create prior-art interference for related patents
#
# Do NOT remove `docs/` or `*_patent*` from this file without explicit
# IP-counsel review. Defense-in-depth: even if removed, `update_lambda.py`'s
# PyGithub push does not push the working tree — but a future manual
# `git push` would expose everything tracked by git.
# =============================================================================

# ---------- Secrets ----------
.env
.env.*
*.token
*.key
secrets/

# ---------- Internal planning + IP-sensitive docs ----------
docs/
*_INTERNAL*.md
*_PRIVATE*.md
INTERNAL_*

# ---------- Patent files (defense-in-depth) ----------
# The .tex/.pdf live in the parent directory, but any copy here is sensitive.
*.tex
*_patent*.pdf
*_patent*.docx

# ---------- Python ----------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
venv/
.venv/

# ---------- Logs (rotate locally; don't push history) ----------
logs/
*.log

# ---------- Local data caches ----------
data_cache/
.cache/
*.cache

# ---------- IDE / editor ----------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ---------- OS junk ----------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------- Generated assets that re-render daily ----------
# (PNGs in assets/ are kept since they're the public dashboard chart;
#  but local scratch images are ignored)
*_scratch.png
scratch_*.png
